-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ORIGINAL UPSTREAM WORKS & THIRD-PARTY ATTRIBUTION NOTICE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Denarmo's Warfarer Revamped is an integrated and expanded derivative work based on
and incorporating code, techniques, and designs from earlier community modifications.
The maintainer (Denarmo) is NOT the original author or sole owner of the upstream
codebases merged into this project.

Original upstream works and contributors retain their original rights and credit:

1. Warfarer's Arsenal
   - Original Creator: LeyDWeMvc (Nexus Mods #1717)
   - Scope: Radial weapon selection wheel GUI architecture, HUD GUI element
     duplication, slow-motion steering logic, and direct equip switching routines.

2. Enhanced Warfarer Vocation
   - Original Creator: mue3UufKW (Nexus Mods #1142)
   - Scope: Dynamic per-weapon skill palette swap system, loadout preset architecture,
     and stamina toggle foundations.

3. REFramework
   - Original Creator: praydog and contributors
   - Repository: https://github.com/praydog/REFramework
   - Scope: REFramework runtime Lua scripting environment, ImGui bindings, and IL2CPP API.

4. Damage Reference & Data
   - Creator: xyzkljl1 (MyDD2Mod)
   - Scope: Damage number world-space rendering references and enemy character-ID/name mapping.

5. Dragon's Dogma 2
   - All game content, assets, fonts, icons, names, and trademarks are property of
     CAPCOM CO., LTD. This mod is an unofficial fan creation and is not affiliated
     with or endorsed by Capcom.

All new contributions, unified architectures, Dark Arisen DLC skill integrations,
combat log HUD enhancements, floating damage number system, bugfixes, and refactors
created by Denarmo are licensed under the MIT License above and may be freely
used, studied, modified, and built upon by others.
